          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Para conceptualizar tus ideas y encender las chispas, Lumbre manda el texto de tus ideas y tu perfil creativo a Claude, una IA de Anthropic. Sin este permiso podés guardar neuronas, pero no se conceptualizan ni se encienden chispas, y el planificador no responde." : {
      "comment" : "[perfil.ai.body]",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To conceptualize your ideas and light your sparks, Lumbre sends the text of your ideas and your creative profile to Claude, an AI by Anthropic. Without this permission you can still save neurons, but nothing gets conceptualized, no sparks are lit and the planner won't reply."
          }
        }
      }
    },
